function journeyProfile(d){return {brand:d.workspaceName,reader:d.reader,goal:d.work,style:d.style,watch:d.scope,frequency:'暂不开启',time:'18:30',day:'周五'};}
function journeyCreateWorkspace(d){return {id:'workspace-'+d.id,directionId:d.id,domain:d.domain,name:d.workspaceName,profile:journeyProfile(d),feedback:{},feedbackDraft:{},feedbackRecords:[],trialRound:1,trialCount:1,lastTask:null};}
function newJourneyState(){return {confirmed:false,directionId:'',activeWorkspaceId:'',trialRound:0,trialCount:1,feedback:{},feedbackDraft:{},feedbackRecords:[],existingMode:false,answers:{time:'unsure'},workspaces:[journeyCreateWorkspace(journeyDirections[0])],excludedIds:[],exploreBatch:0,exploreFilter:'all',showAll:false,newUser:false};}
function journeyState(){if(!state.journey)state.journey=newJourneyState();const j=state.journey;if(!Array.isArray(j.workspaces))j.workspaces=[];if(!Array.isArray(j.excludedIds))j.excludedIds=[];return j;}
function journeyDirection(){return journeyDirections.find(d=>d.id===journeyState().directionId)||journeyDirections[0];}
function journeyTopics(){const d=journeyDirection();return d.topics.map(t=>({...t,domain:d.domain}));}
function journeySampleDescriptor(i){const topics=journeyTopics();const n=Number.isInteger(i)&&i>=0&&i<topics.length?i:0;return {topicIndex:n,experimentGoal:'试着向读者讲清：'+topics[n].argument,question:topics[n].title};}
function journeyClone(value){return value==null?value:JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value));}
function journeyProfileSnapshot(p){const result={};['brand','reader','goal','style','watch','frequency','time','day'].forEach(k=>{if(p&&p[k]!==undefined)result[k]=p[k];});return result;}
function journeySaveWorkspace(){const j=journeyState(),w=j.workspaces.find(x=>x.id===j.activeWorkspaceId);if(!w)return;w.profile=journeyProfileSnapshot(state.profile);w.name=w.profile.brand||w.name;['feedback','feedbackDraft','feedbackRecords'].forEach(k=>{w[k]=journeyClone(j[k]);});w.trialRound=j.trialRound;w.trialCount=journeyTrialCount();if(state.task&&state.task.workspaceId===w.id)w.lastTask=journeyClone(state.task);}
function journeyGuard(action){if(state.editing){toast('有未保存改稿，请先回内容页保存或撤回，再切换；改稿仍保留。');return false;}if(state.generating){toast('样稿正在展开，请完成后再切换，避免工作空间串台。');return false;}action();return true;}
function journeyGo(route){journeyGuard(()=>go(route));}
function journeyActivateWorkspace(id,route='plan'){return journeyGuard(()=>{const j=journeyState();let w=j.workspaces.find(x=>x.id===id||x.directionId===id);if(!w){const d=journeyDirections.find(x=>x.id===id||'workspace-'+x.id===id);if(!d)return;w=journeyCreateWorkspace(d);j.workspaces.push(w);}if(j.activeWorkspaceId!==w.id){journeySaveWorkspace();j.activeWorkspaceId=w.id;j.directionId=w.directionId;j.confirmed=true;j.trialRound=w.trialRound||1;j.trialCount=w.trialCount||1;['feedback','feedbackDraft','feedbackRecords'].forEach(k=>{j[k]=journeyClone(w[k]||(k==='feedbackRecords'?[]:{}));});state.profile=journeyProfileSnapshot(w.profile);state.task=journeyClone(w.lastTask);state.editing=false;}else{j.confirmed=true;j.directionId=w.directionId;}if(route)go(route);});}
function journeyConfirm(id){journeyActivateWorkspace(id,'plan');}
function journeyExisting(){journeyGuard(()=>{const j=journeyState();if(!j.activeWorkspaceId)journeyActivateWorkspace('finance',null);j.existingMode=true;go('automation');});}
function journeyNote(text){const e=node('div','journey-note',text);e.setAttribute('role','status');return e;}
